# Ket ma dong: trong kho LUON la LF, va checkout ra cung LF.
#
# Khong co dong nay thi tren Windows (core.autocrlf=true) git doi LF -> CRLF
# luc checkout, con prettier mac dinh doi LF -> `npm run verify` do ngay o
# buoc dau voi hang tram file, du noi dung trong kho hoan toan dung.
# CI chay tren Linux nen khong bao gio thay loi nay.
* text=auto eol=lf

# File nhi phan: khong dung vao.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
